url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/immu4989/lurescope"
abstract: >-
  LureScope safely triages RFC 5322 email, scores fraud-lure likelihood, applies
  adversarial attacks, and tests an input-normalization defense. LureProof adds a
  strict, privacy-minimized evidence artifact containing detector and threshold
  provenance plus attack and defense outcomes without message content. A standard
  DSSE envelope can authenticate the statement against an external trust key.
  The inbox workflow turns reported-email queues into minimized routing manifests,
  per-case proofs, and offline SIEM payloads.
version: 0.7.0
